Phaemos STM32 Black Pill Vibration Node - Proteus ISIS Schematic Placeholder

This file is a placeholder. The actual Proteus schematic (.pdsprj)
will be created in Phase 2/3 using Proteus ISIS.

Components to place in Phase 2:
- STM32F411CEU6 Black Pill module
- MPU6050 breakout (I2C1, PB6=SCL, PB7=SDA)
- UART output (PA9=TX to ESP32 RX)
- 3.3V power from host or AMS1117
